p07 : V4.4
p08 : US Blanks 6'8"EPS (2010 catalog vector extraction; catalog volume unavailable)
p97 : Designed for versatility to accommodate a wide range of board styles from Fishes to Big Guy short boards. The manufacturing process ensures uniform density and fusion throughout, thus allowing the shaper to use the maximum width of the blank if necessary. A closer tolerance version to yeild a quick shape and generate less waste.
